      <text class="desc">宽窄巷子、春熙路、玉林路……周末两天吃遍成都，附详细路线与人均消费。</text>
      <view class="action-row">
        <text class="action-fwd" @click="onForward">转发</text>
        <text class="action-del" @click="onDelete">删除</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</template>

<script setup lang="uts">
const goBack = () => {
  uni.navigateBack({ delta: 1 })
}

const onMore = () => {
  uni.showToast({ title: '更多', icon: 'none' })
}

const onForward = () => {
  uni.showToast({ title: '已转发', icon: 'success' })
}

const onDelete = () => {
  uni.showToast({ title: '已删除收藏', icon: 'success' })
  setTimeout(() => {
    uni.navigateBack({ delta: 1 })
  }, 1500)
}
</script>

